### OMS5 create timesheet

### Request JSON Schema
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "employee_id",
    "shift_id",
    "work_date",
    "hours"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "employee_id": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 1
    },
    "shift_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "work_date": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date"
    },
    "hours": {
      "type": "number",
      "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
      "maximum": 24
    }
  }
}
```

response.body:
{
  "detail": [{
    "loc": ["body", "hours"],
    "msg": "Input should be less than or equal to 24",
    "type": "less_than_equal"
  }]
}
